      "type": "text",
      "value": "Make use of the following modal auxiliary verbs in sentence as asked in brackets. (12)"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "(i) Can. (To express offer to somebody else)"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "(ii) Could. (To express a past ability)"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "(iii) Would. (To express a polite request)"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "(iv) Used to. (To express a past regular habit)"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "(v) Dare. (To express indulgence)"
    },
    {
